.TH "GF-QUOTA-UPDATE-ORG-QUOTA" "1" "May 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
gf-quota-update-org-quota - Updates user quota


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf quota update-org-quota [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Updates user quota

.PP
If you are running Grafana Enterprise and have Fine-grained access control enabled, you need to have a permission with action \fBorgs.quotas:write\fR and scope \fBorg:id:1\fR (orgIDScope).

.PP
Body schema (UpdateQuotaCmd):
  limit   number
  target  string

.PP
Response schema (UpdateOrgQuotaOK.Payload):
  message  string


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--body\fP=""
	Request body JSON or path to a JSON file (e.g. --body=/path/to/body.json, --body='{"foo": "bar"}'). The 'Body schema' block below lists fields and types; use --describe-body-jsonschema for a strict JSON Schema.

